; =====================================================================
; Geo_Prep_pk2.dat -- Geo_Prep.dat with the joist pockets at the TEST heights (29 Oct 2026).
; Moshfeghi et al. (2024), Structures 66, 106815, Fig. 5: joist tops 425 mm and 425 + 1855 = 2280 mm above the masonry
; base. Pockets moved one course each, on existing bed joints of Groningen.dec (course pitch 58.64 mm), joist depth
; kept at three courses (175.9 mm; the real section is not confirmed):
;     lower pocket  y 0.23455 - 0.41045   (courses 4-6; was 0.29318 - 0.46909)   top 15 mm below the test's 425
;     upper pocket  y 2.11091 - 2.28682   (courses 36-38; was 2.05227 - 2.22818) top  7 mm above the test's 2280
; Pocket plan position and depth unchanged: x 0.3230-0.4038 and 0.8883-0.9690, z 0.105-0.210 (half the thickness,
; joist side).
; The second z = 0.105 cut is applied to EVERY course of each band near the pockets. Geo_Prep.dat applied it to the
; middle course only, which in the old bands was the header course (12 bricks); the new bands hold two header courses
; each (4 and 6, 36 and 38). Where a block is already split the cut does nothing.
; Output: GEO_WALL_pk2.sav (GEO_WALL.sav is not touched). Build with ANALYSIS_PART_I_MASON_pk2.dat.
; =====================================================================
model new
model config dynamic
model dynamic active off
model large-strain off

call 'Groningen.dec'

;SUPPORT BLOCK
block create brick 0 1.292 -0.05 0 0.0 0.210 group 'S'

;TOP BEAM
block create brick 0 1.292 2.58 2.68 0.0 0.210 group 'T_B'

; ---- pocket bands visible only -------------------------------------------------------------
block hide range pos-y -10000 0.2346
block hide range pos-y 0.4105 2.1109
block hide range pos-y 2.2869 100000

block cut joint-set dip 0 dip-direction 0 origin 0 0 0.105

; ---- second cut at z = 0.105: every course of both bands, near the pockets only -------------
block hide
block hide off range pos-y 0.2346 0.4105
block hide off range pos-y 2.1109 2.2869
block hide pos-x 0 0.32
block hide pos-x 0.96 11
block hide pos-x 0.43 0.85
block cut joint-set dip 0 dip-direction 0 origin 0 0 0.105

; ---- remove the pocket volume: bands, joist half (z > 0.105), between the pocket faces -------
block hide off

block hide range pos-y -10000 0.2346
block hide range pos-y 0.4105 2.1109
block hide range pos-y 2.2869 100000

block hide range pos-z -1 0.105

block cut joint-set dip 90 dip-direction 90 origin 0.3230 0 0
block cut joint-set dip 90 dip-direction 90 origin 0.4038 0 0
block delete range pos-x 0.3230 0.4038

block cut joint-set dip 90 dip-direction 90 origin 0.8883 0 0
block cut joint-set dip 90 dip-direction 90 origin 0.9690 0 0
block delete range pos-x 0.8883 0.9690

block hide off
block group "Masonry" range group "S" or "T_B" not
model save 'GEO_WALL_pk2'
